# Standing instructions & context for the morning briefing

Anything in this file is read by the assistant every morning and factored into the
briefing. Add a line anytime — plain English. Delete lines when they no longer apply.
(You can edit this yourself, or just tell your AI CLI "add a note: ...".)

Copy this file to `notes.md` and replace the examples below with your own.

## Ongoing preferences
<!-- e.g. "Keep it under ~150 words." -->
<!-- e.g. "Always call out recruiter emails." -->
<!-- e.g. "Family / milestone / anniversary events are important — never suggest
     deleting them. Highlight them warmly near the top of the briefing." -->

## Inbox
<!-- e.g. "Daily auto-declutter is ON (inbox_cleanup.py --declutter): it marks read +
     archives + labels known bulk senders. These are noise — don't surface them." -->
<!-- e.g. "Never auto-touch / always keep in inbox: real bank/bill alerts, security
     emails, anything from a real person." -->
<!-- To add a sender to the noise list, edit `NOISE` in `inbox_cleanup.py`. -->
<!-- e.g. "Content-aware triage is ON: read each remaining unread and archive the
     routine/no-action ones, keeping anything actionable, personal, financial, or
     from a real person. When unsure, keep." -->

## Unsubscribe suggestions
<!-- e.g. "Never suggest unsubscribing from: my own app's notifications, my web
     host, real banks/bills." -->
<!-- e.g. "I'm unsubscribing from LinkedIn myself — stop suggesting it." -->
<!-- Don't repeat a suggestion already acted on or dismissed — tracked in
     `unsub_suggested.txt`. -->

## Calendar context (whose event is whose)
<!-- e.g. "'Pilates' sessions on the calendar are my partner's, not mine — don't give
     me workout prep nudges for those, just mention them as household logistics." -->
<!-- e.g. "My own recurring workouts: gym (Mon/Wed/Fri), climbing (Tue)." -->

## Reminders / things to watch
<!-- e.g. "Expecting a package this week — flag the delivery." -->
<!-- e.g. "Renew passport before August." -->
<!-- e.g. "UFC watch: numbered events only; nearby cities = Las Vegas, LA, San Diego —
     flag announcements and ticket sales so I can buy early." -->

## Temporary context (remember to clear)
<!-- e.g. "On vacation Jul 10–15 — go light, skip work email." -->
